msgstr "Failure frames to keep"

msgid "单个等待/轮询步骤的默认超时；任务里显式传超时的位置不受影响"
msgstr "Default timeout for a single wait/poll step; places that pass an explicit timeout are unaffected"

msgid "动作验证失败后重试之间的间隔，0 表示不额外等待"
msgstr "Delay between retries after a failed verification; 0 means no extra wait"

msgid "动作成功后追加的稳定等待，0 表示不等待"
msgstr "Extra settle wait after a successful action; 0 means no wait"

msgid "画面长时间不变（判定为可能卡死）的阈值，只记录警告不中止任务"
msgstr "Threshold for an unchanged screen (possible freeze); only logs a warning, never aborts the task"

msgid "低配机器：所有超时统一放宽 1.5 倍，卡死阈值同步放宽"
msgstr "Low-spec machines: all timeouts are relaxed by 1.5×, including the stuck threshold"

msgid "任务失败后自动按返回键退回主菜单，只退菜单不重跑任务"
msgstr "After a failure, press Back to return to the main menu; it never re-runs the task"

msgid "失败后最多按几次返回键"
msgstr "Maximum number of Back presses after a failure"

msgid "失败帧库最多保留多少帧，超出后丢弃最旧的"
msgstr "How many failure frames to keep; the oldest are dropped"
